plugin-qualify (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Play instruments when qualifying them, and add an omx-clap-host profile
    (#72)
  * Release 0.10.0: host probe installed, latency read at the response's
    arrival
  * native: install the LV2 host probe beside the measurer
  * native: drop openmixer's copy of the LV2 measurer and its parity test
  * Release 0.9.1: latency read at the response's arrival
  * clap-qualify: read the impulse's arrival against the response's peak
  * CI: apt takes no version relation on the command line, the plugin-hostd
    floor is checked after the install (#67)
  * pins-file test: one CI guard for the native build, not two (#67)
  * CI: run the pins-file test against the published plugin-hostd (#67)

